match to this audience. null for non-deprecated / unlinked rows."},"filters":{"type":"object","nullable":true,"additionalProperties":{"nullable":true}},"avatarUrl":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"description":"Audience avatar as a hosted HTTP(S) URL. null until generated."},"apolloCount":{"type":"integer","nullable":true},"apifyCount":{"type":"integer","nullable":true},"countedAt":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"degraded":{"type":"boolean","description":"The chooser's verdict on the audience it picked for this row: true when no attempt apollo-service explored really answered the request and the least-bad one was chosen anyway. INFORMATION for the customer and the dashboard — nothing here blocks, filters or warns on it, and an audience is always chosen. false for rows created before the flag existed and whenever the chooser judged the pick a genuine answer."},"createdByUserId":{"type":"string"","note":"Narrow the request (a filter, a limit, one id) to read the rest."}}],"needsTheirYes":false}

